------------------------------------------------------------

In the present study, a total of 48 injected zygotes were transferred into the oviducts of three surrogate rabbits. After full-term gestation, the three surrogate mothers successfully gave birth to 12 live pups ([Table 1](#T1){ref-type="table"}).

